\fs28 \cf2 Weekly Volume Ramp Profile\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 A mesocycle spans $4\\text\{--\}6$ active training weeks followed by a $1$-week deload. 
\fs30 \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 PlanKit
\fs24 \cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  uses a linear-step progression from MEV to MRV across accumulating weeks $W_1 \\dots W_N$:\
$$V_\{\\text\{target\}\}(W_k) = \\text\{MEV\} + \\left( \\frac\{k - 1\}\{N - 1\} \\right) \\times (\\text\{MRV\} - \\text\{MEV\})$$\
For a standard 5-week accumulation mesocycle ($N=5$) with $\\text\{MEV\} = 10.0$ and $\\text\{MRV\} = 18.0$:\
