\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 Nutritional state (Cut, Maintain, Surplus) changes recovery capacity, systemic fatigue, and muscle building capability. 
\fs30 \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 PlanKit
\fs24 \cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  enforces adjustment scalars across the volume and progression layers depending on the user's active nutritional phase.\

